# Notes
# - Use real keys only in local/private env files, never commit them.
# - Groq keys are used by the app for text/audio creative layers when available.
# - Gemini is used for Gemini tasks and cover image generation on user request.
# - YouTube API key is used for externalMarketData / comparables.

